# Route: guide 13 of 51 of the simulator's completionist route for Tauren
# (1211 of 1222 eligible quests, 160.2 h, world baeac23fbe5e): levels 31 to
# 34, 13 quests, 4.7 h under the model. The order is the simulator's (`sim run
# --objective completionist`, then `sim export`; docs/SIMULATION.md §10): fix
# a step in the exporter or the data, not only here, so the next export keeps
# it.
#
# Flow (Stranglethorn Vale): Grom'gol Base Camp -> Kal'ai Ruins -> Bal'lal
# Ruins -> Grom'gol Base Camp -> Bal'lal Ruins -> Grom'gol Base Camp -> The
# Vile Reef -> Grom'gol Base Camp -> Ruins of Zul'Kunda -> Grom'gol Base Camp
# -> Booty Bay -> Crystalvein Mine -> Bal'lal Ruins -> ….
#
# Profession quests here are not routed (they need the skill): 2760 The
# Mithril Order; 2761 Smelt On, Smelt Off; 2762 The Great Silver Deceiver;
# 2763 The Art of the Imbue; 2764 Galvan's Finest Pupil; 2765 Expert
# Blacksmith!; 3642 The Pledge of Secrecy; 3643 Show Your Work; 3645
# Membership Card Renewal; 5148 Tribal Leatherworking.
#
# Left to other guides: class quests (the Class category).

